{"seq":2,"slug":"node-types","title":"节点类型详解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"composite-nodes","title":"组合节点：Sequence、Selector 与 Parallel","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types/composite-nodes","wordCount":634,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"decorator-nodes","title":"装饰节点：修改行为语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types/decorator-nodes","wordCount":632,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"leaf-nodes","title":"叶节点：Action、Condition 与 Service","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types/leaf-nodes","wordCount":618,"readingTime":3}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"节点类型详解\">节点类型详解</h1><p>本章深入三类节点的语义与实现：<strong>组合节点</strong>（Sequence/Selector/Parallel）控制执行流；<strong>装饰节点</strong>（Inverter/Repeater/Cooldown 等）修改子节点语义；<strong>叶节点</strong>（Action/Condition/Service）实现具体行为逻辑。掌握每类节点的精确语义是构建正确 BT 的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"composite-nodes\">组合节点：Sequence、Selector 与 Parallel</a></td>\n<td>三类组合节点的语义、时序与嵌套组合模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"decorator-nodes\">装饰节点：修改行为语义</a></td>\n<td>Inverter/Repeater/Cooldown/ForceSuccess/TimeLimit 的实现与用途</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"leaf-nodes\">叶节点：Action、Condition 与 Service</a></td>\n<td>行动节点、条件节点、服务节点的设计原则与常见实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}